---
import research from '@/data/research.yaml'; const asset=(p:string)=>`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}${p.replace(/^\//,'')}`;
---
<section data-reveal><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Current focus</p><h2>Research at the boundary</h2></div><p>The most interesting systems questions appear where neat abstractions meet batteries, weather, weak networks, sensitive data, and human priorities.</p></div><div class="research-grid">{research.map((r,i)=><article class="research-card"><span class="number">0{i+1}</span><div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">⌁</div><h3><a href={asset(`/topics/${r.slug}/`)}>{r.title}</a></h3><p>{r.summary}</p></article>)}</div></section>
